    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/a1f8cdf271c82aa34c4c3c33714be45d.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alright, we're going to rush to our target destination.&quot;</strong><br><strong>Fusion Steampunk Style Novel Adventure Game \u300cVoid Soul\u300d</strong><br><br>\u2699\ufe0f The Story of a desert empire and a rebel train that rises against it <br>\u2699\ufe0f Dot graphic adventure exploring, diverse puzzles and countless events <br>\u2699\ufe0f Over 17 hours of epic steampunk storytelling!<br><br><strong>Dive into an explosive tale fueled by endless revenge and a twisted longing for family\u2014where two burning emotions ignite a journey to the very end!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/b74a9eee1839ea53807701a1485750b0.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full-featured PC Complete Edition of Void Soul is here!</strong><br><br>\u2699\ufe0f Experience the True Ending of the story after progressing through 14 chapters <br>\u2699\ufe0f What if you had made a different choice\u2026? Discover 4 Bad Endings that change based on your decisions<br>\u2699\ufe0f The first encounter between Cadet Cassius and the boy Klaproth, featuring an exclusive extra story available only in the Complete Edition<br><br>\u2757 The limited extra story and Bad Endings unlock from your second playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/b3bd689ff1119242ff9377ebde151eb1.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/2e8994bd029cfd02a8ee4509a3e9a2eb.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Charming characters and stories such as Chief Commander of rebel train or Emperor longing for revenge<br>\u00a0 - Story full of love and revenge, laughter and touching, solemnness and madness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0fDot graphic adventure exploring fortress in desert, train, palace and more<br>\u00a0 - Manipulate character to explore various fields by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0fLuxurious voice actors and your liking standing images &amp; illustrations<br>\u00a0 - Play delighting your eyes and ears! Enjoy the crucial moment for 200%!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0fBattle that has various puzzles &amp; simple but suspenseful<br>\u00a0 - Be the one with character and get over the odds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/5cec4b4095820d0c10fe845427b3a15c.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f<strong>Character introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 TESLA<br>The head of rebels confronting the empire and chief commander of infinite-energy train Tesla Leads rebels only to revenge the empire that destroyed hometown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 COIL<br>Captain of Tesla's rebels<br>He is an ace with the best combat capability but deeply rely to Tesla mentally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 DESTY<br>Army Surgeon of Tesla's rebels<br>Mysterious mad doctor. He had a crush on Tesla's eyes at first sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 KLAPROTH<br>Emperor who does everything whatever it takes to achieve goal<br>He seems to be obsessed with Tesla</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/a1f8cdf271c82aa34c4c3c33714be45d.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alright, we're going to rush to our target destination.&quot;</strong><br><strong>Fusion Steampunk Style Novel Adventure Game \u300cVoid Soul\u300d</strong><br><br>\u2699\ufe0f The Story of a desert empire and a rebel train that rises against it <br>\u2699\ufe0f Dot graphic adventure exploring, diverse puzzles and countless events <br>\u2699\ufe0f Over 17 hours of epic steampunk storytelling!<br><br><strong>Dive into an explosive tale fueled by endless revenge and a twisted longing for family\u2014where two burning emotions ignite a journey to the very end!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/b74a9eee1839ea53807701a1485750b0.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full-featured PC Complete Edition of Void Soul is here!</strong><br><br>\u2699\ufe0f Experience the True Ending of the story after progressing through 14 chapters <br>\u2699\ufe0f What if you had made a different choice\u2026? Discover 4 Bad Endings that change based on your decisions<br>\u2699\ufe0f The first encounter between Cadet Cassius and the boy Klaproth, featuring an exclusive extra story available only in the Complete Edition<br><br>\u2757 The limited extra story and Bad Endings unlock from your second playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581980/extras/b3bd689ff1119242ff9377ebde151eb1.avif?t=1746751678\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl